<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><br></font></p>



<p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p>



<p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},<br></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p>



<p style=""><b><font size="2">RE: {!Case.Baggage_File_Reference__c}</font></b></p><p style=""><b><font size="2"><br></font></b></p>

<p style=""><font size="2">Thanks for returning your Release Form and advising your replacement bag selection.</font></p>

<p style=""><font size="2">This is to confirm that a <b><i>-bag size- </i></b>cm,<b><i> -bag colour-</i></b> <b><i>-bag type-</i></b> bag has been ordered for you today.&nbsp;You will receive your replacement baggage within the next week. Please let us know if there is a delay.</font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p>

<p style=""><font size="2">Once you receive your new bag, it is important that you log on to the manufacturer’s website to arrange registration of your warranty. Please log on to<a href="http:// https://www.delsey.com/fr/en/guarantee" target="_blank"> </a><a href="https://www.delsey.com/en/guarantee" target="_blank">https://www.delsey.com/en/guarantee</a>. The date of purchase is the date you receive your new bag.</font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p>

<p style=""><font size="2">Once you have received your new bag, we ask you to kindly destroy and dispose of your damaged bag.</font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p>

<p style=""><font size="2">Once again, on behalf of the team at Qantas, we apologise for the inconvenience experienced.&nbsp;We are confident that you will be delighted with your new baggage and look forward to welcoming you on board again soon.</font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p>



<p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p>

<p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p>

<p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p>

<p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p>



<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: white; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
